  provenance: "AUTHORED: a game-level archetype after typical marine weather, not
    an observation. METAR cover classes and the WMO fog and mist limits are from
    WMO No. 306 and No. 8 (from memory, verify). Rain rates sit in the WMO light,
    moderate and heavy classes (below 2.5, to 10, to 50 mm/h; from memory, verify)
    under the 7\u20138 oktas rain falls from (slice 3, E53)."
